  {
   "id": "694c60c559254b3aa22833bf",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Apartment Interior Design in Eurovea City, Bratislava, Custom Furniture, 56 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong> developed the interior design for a 56 m² apartment in <strong>Eurovea City</strong>, Bratislava. The project was based on the developer’s existing finishes, with a focus on functional space planning, contemporary aesthetics and comfortable urban living."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The central space of the apartment is an open-plan kitchen and living room with a kitchen island, combining cooking, dining and relaxation areas. The apartment also includes a bedroom with a workspace, laundry room, bathroom, entrance hall with integrated storage and a terrace."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project was developed within the <a href=\"/en/custom-furniture-bratislava-design-production\">Furniture Design Package</a> and includes the interior concept, photorealistic 3D visualizations, technical documentation, as well as the design and production of custom-made cabinetry in Bratislava."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The custom furniture was designed together with the interior, allowing the available space to be used efficiently and integrating storage systems and other furniture elements into the architecture of the apartment. Upholstered furniture, lighting and decorative elements were also carefully selected for the project."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The interior features a light neutral color palette, natural materials, minimalist décor and functional solutions. All elements were adapted to the client’s budget while maintaining a balance between aesthetics, practicality and contemporary design. The project was also supported by DUMSKAYA DESIGN’s design supervision."
      }
     ]
    },
